    <string name="settings_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_body">Manga Translator translates chapters you own from English to Arabic using OCR and AI running on a secure server. No secret keys are stored in the app.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">We collect your Google account data (name, email, photo), the images you upload, extracted text and translations, and usage records. We use them only to provide translation and enforce your plan limits. Images are sent to OCR and translation providers solely for processing. We never use your edits to train any model without explicit consent. Deleting your account removes your data and images from our servers immediately; anonymised financial records may be kept where the law requires.</string>
    <string name="terms_body">Use the app only for content you own or are allowed to translate. Copyright infringement and abusive automation are prohibited. Plans and daily limits are enforced on the server in UTC. We may suspend abusive accounts.</string>
